  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greetng By Billy**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Nashville Blues**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Hold The Wood Pile Down**: back after 64 archived shows (481 days) [2]\n- **Old Dangerfield**: back after 159 archived shows (990 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Jam**: back after 74 archived shows (558 days) [2]\n- **Kentcky Mandolin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **#Stratosphere Blues**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **I Believe In You**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-09** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 162 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-09**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Taped by Z-Man, who also seeded it, with Mean Gene Sego as taper's assistant; processed via Sound Forge and CD Wave to FLAC 16-bit [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center - Tampa, FL - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/yuengling-center-tampa-fl-3/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/yuengling-center-2025-regular-poster/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Yuengling Center 2025 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/yuengling-center-2025-regular-poster/) [5]",
